  <para style="h">Afyisuyi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Afyisuyi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Afyisuyi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Afs</para>
  <para style="mt1">Afyisuyi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Bwulus, Kirisiti Yeisu tnutnuloyi, n Shekwoyi ɓəyei.</para>
  <para style="po" vid="EPH 1:1">Kwoi lo da Shekwoyi aza agyigyiyi fyi ń Afyisus, agbenuyi fyi n Kirisiti Yeisu.<verse eid="EPH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Shebmyashi n bwugbafui ɓa ɓe da fye, n ɓa kwnu n Shekwoyi əyi Dada aba ɓədo n Dagayi Yeisu Kirisitii.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Zafnu anabəlika n cicii dna n Kirisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Yi ci Shekwoyi, Dada əyi Dagayi Yeisu Kirisiti nya, n wo la anabəlika tu əyi n əshebmana n anabəlika zafnu nya dəhodəhoii dna n Kirisiti. <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Ntuge wo ɓə la yi knyí fyi n wo, to ai zhni anyii m, ya kwu zhni agyigyiyi jesnu a tnaɓətuyi zhi n əwo awyeba. Dna ń yeye, <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />waa yi pmaknyi zhi ntuge wa gwo yi, n zhni anugwnu dna n Yeisu Kirisiti kwoi vyi əwo agbmada ɓədo n əwo ɓəyei; <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />kwa ɓé ǹ cicii əwo shebmyashi latu nya, n wo la ga yi dna n əza n wo ye ncei nyi. <verse eid="EPH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />Dna ń əwo nu n yi kwu shnashna ɓwa n əwo amii, əyi aleifyi zozo, kwoi vyi nyaɓwa Shekwoyi shebmyashi nya, <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />ń wo ɓə zeya kpe ń yi nyi. N wyemwai vnyanya ɓədo n awyegai, <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />Shekwoyi wo kwu əwo asigyi wu yi, əɓo n kwo ɓə soshi, kwoi vyi əwo agbmada manai n wo ɓə ncei mwushi dna n Kirisiti, <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />shi əkwo nunusa ɓə si, kwoi ya tnutnu, kwoi yé anya zhi vnyanya n abagbmanyi, dna n əshemi n anyii dna n Kirisiti snuta. <verse eid="EPH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Dna n əwo nu ń a ɓə knyí yi, ntuge a ɓə la yi pmaknyi zhi kwoi vyi əwo ɓəmwushi, n wo zhni ɓəhoɓəhoi kwoi vyi əwo ɓətukwo ɓəye nyi, <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />nabai ge əyi, n yi nu ɓə zhni akpmisnuyi n ɓa ɓə tu awye n Kirisiti nyi, n kwo ɓa myi kwa ɓe n cicii əwo latu nya. <verse eid="EPH 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Njesnu əfyehni ce, a ɓə n fyei ba fyi n Kirisiti she fye ɓə wo waazi gaiciyanunui nya, nabagyi manai əfye gnyignyi nya. She fye ɓə kwu gaiciya ga, a ɓə kwu fye kpeaznù fyi n wo n atuzèi, ɓəgbeshi Zafnu Gyigyiyi nya. <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />Əwo nu zhni nyasaya əyi əgwú wnashi nya, kwoi nya aza yi shnashna əsa n ɓa zhni Shekwoyi nyaɓwa nyi; kwoi ɓe wo n latui cicii.<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amisa n aduwazhnii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Ntu dəye ɓo, tunyi əsa n mi ɓə wo əfye gaiciyaga ɓo dna n Dagayi Yeisu, jesnu əfye yeyei ntu n Shekwoyi aza vnyanya ɓo, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />mi too fa Shekwoyi amisa ntu n əfye ɓo m, mii pa fye ɓo dna n əmi aduwazhni. <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />Ciici mi nya Shekwoyi əyi Dagayi Yeisu Kirisiti nya əɓo lo, Dada latuyi, wa ga fye Zafnu wyemwa nya n ɓəwyegye nyai, nabai n fye ɓa kpe wo ye n dudu. <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />Mi zhniaduwa nge awye əfye adu nya ɓa ɓwa bwuznagna, nabai n fye ɓa kpe awyetu ye n a yi fye ntu əkwo ɓo nyi, nyaɓwa əwo əgwú latu nya, fyi n əwo aza agyigyiyi. <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />Njesnu əwo ikwo yaakwo tnadomwii ga yi n yi kwu gaiciya ga nyi. Kalá yi zhni nyagbmanyi nu n kalá ikwo duduyi nyai <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />n wo ɓə zhniapma ncei əsa n wo ɓə la Kirisiti kala n əfyi jesnu waa wo sasetu n əwo ɓwaizheɓwa fyi n ashebmana, <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />n du abegyi vnyanya n ikwoi, n ikwo duduyii njesnu n əye dəhodəhoi n a yi, to ɓwasnu n cala nsaiye nya m, ama ɓədo n ədoi n kwo ye ɓeɓelo nyi. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Njesnu Shekwoyi wa kwu anya vnyanya fyi n əwo apitabwada snuta, waa wo knyi waa zè tukwoda tu n nyahonyahoi əshe, ga ikilisiya, <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />ń əkwo nu zhni əwo nayi nyi, n əwo nu nú nyahonyahoi n zokwo dəhodəhoi.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ɓa kwu wyewyeyi ɓwa dna n Kirisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Əfye, fye ɓə fyifyiyi nu fyi n kwnukwnuiya n ofye n aleifyii; <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />shi fye ɓə zhni fyei gyianyì n wu, əsa n fye ɓə wna anyì ye zokwo ɓədo n begyiyi əse əbemi nya, zafnu n wo zhni tnutnu nsaiye fyi n aza yi ń ɓa ta vyi ɓəgbetu m. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Əyi vnyanya ce, yi ɓə kwu anyì gyi fyi n ɓa, dna ń saho, yii dagbma fyi n pwawonukwoi əyi nayi nya, jesnu yii vyi əyi aɓəpwawo ɓədo n aɓonubwozhnii. Ngye azaje n ɓa ce nyi, yi ɓə kwnuce ya gwo minagyi napyei nu. <verse eid="EPH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Ama ntu əwo yeye yaakwo ɓo ga yi, Shekwoyi, ń əwo snusnugye mwalo nyi, <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />waa yi kwukazhi n wyewyeyi n kwnusnu ń Kirisitii, kwo əsa n yi ɓə fyifyiyi fyi n əyi kwnukwnuiya n ofye; n ɓəmanai nu n a la fye gnyi. <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Njesnu Shekwoyi wa kwu yi kala zhi n kwnusnu n Kirisitii, wa kwu yi sase kpe ń kwnusnu n woi fyi n ashebmana dna n Kirisiti Yeisu. <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />Nabai nge cala n kwo ɓəlo n abye nyi, n wo ɓə myi wa wu nyaɓwa əwo shebmyashi nya n a taa myi a mwukwodo m, n wo kwu kwo wu yi dna n əwo shebmyashi dna n Kirisiti Yeisu. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Ntuge n ɓəmanai nu ń a la fye gnyi, ntu gaiciyaga ɓo; jesnu dəye to zhni əfye ɓəzhni nu m, kwo zhni Shekwoyi nyaga nu. <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />Toge ntu ń atnutnuzhni ɓo nu m, nabai ń zahozahoyi taa gyigbe m. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Ntuge yi zhni Shekwoyi aɓwa tńutńu nu, n wo ɓə zhni dna n Kirisiti Yeisu, ya zhni atnutnu amanai, ado n Shekwoyi ɓə la ɓa zhnizhi ga yi n sapa, nge ya zhni nyi.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A kwu Ayahudiyi wnado n Abyedoi dna n Kirisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Ntucenu, fye pa ge n sapa, əfye n a ɓə ma fye n zhni Abyedo nyi, jesnu aza yi n ɓa yi əɓahni nge anyaznuyii, ɓai yi fye nge, “atnanyaznuyii” (ənya n a zhni dna n nayi n azanyikwoci aɓwai). <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />Fye pá nge dna nsayii, fye ɓə kpmikpmiiya n Kirisiti, n kwnukwnuiya ń Israila əbyé, jesnu n zhni aɓəgbeshi azhiɓeyi, ntna awyetu, jesnu ntna Shekwoyi fyi n anyì. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Ama nsaiye, dna n Kirisiti Yeisu, əfye n fye ɓə mwakpa n woi nsaho nyi, a kwu ɓe n fyei vyivyiwyi ntu Kirisiti ami ɓo.<verse eid="EPH 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Ntuge Kirisiti n əwohni tukwoi nu zhni əyi bwugbafu, n wo la akwu ngwnu-aba yeɓədo, jesnu wo kwu abagwu-zokwo zhniagbma, ənya n kwo ɓe n nuwnu nyakwnupa ajegnai. <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />Wo kwu owa zo dna n əwo nayi ɓədo n əkwo awyidnai n əkwo aɓəgbekpei. Əwo ɓəmwi nu ɓə nyì nge, wa zhni əza woiwoi dna n wohni, woi gbmi n aza ngwnu-aba nabai a ɓwa bwugbafu. <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />Njesnu dna n nayi gbmanyi, wa kwu ɓa je yeɓədo n kwnusnu ga Shekwoyi n znudui, zokwo n wo ɓə wu əɓa nuwnu ncei nyi. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Wa ɓe wa zhni waazi bwugbafu nya ga fye, n fye ɓə taya zhi n kpaai nyi, jesnu bwugbafu ga aza n ɓa ɓə wo vyivyiwyi nyi. <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />Ntuge dna n əwo nu n əyi ngwnu-aba yi la zokwo ɓwa lo Dada aba n Zafnu gbmanyii.<verse eid="EPH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Ntu dəye ɓo, fye to ye zhni aknyidoda nu, kwo azhiɓeyi m, ama aknyida n kwnusnu n Shekwoyi azai, jesnu Shekwoyi apwuwada. <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />A n fyei mikpe n atnutnuyi shnipa nu ɓədo n asheɓəgwognayi nyai, ń Kirisiti Yeisu əwohni tukwo nu zhni nyaknuɓwakwonu kwuta tukwo nyi. <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />Dna n əwo nù n nyakwnu vnyanya yeɓədo n aba gbmanyi, kwoi mwagwnu kwaa zè dagayipwuwa gyigyiyi dna n Dagayi. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Njesnu dna n əwo nu ce, ń a gnyi ai mi fye ɓədo fya kwu zè aseseba, aba n Shekwoyi sase dna n əwo Zafnu.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Shekwoyi ɓəmwushi manai ntu n Abyedo ɓo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Ntu ɓəye ɓo əmi, Bwulus, mi dna n zhalu da Kirisiti Yeisu ɓo nu, ntu əfye Abyedo ɓo.<verse eid="EPH 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />Ɓəhnihni, fye kwu Shekwoyi shebmyashi aɓəfyekpe ɓo wo, n a ɓə ga mi ntu əfye ɓo nyi, <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />əkwo nu zhni asigyi ń a ɓə wu mi ɓa n ɓəwyegye, ngye shi mi ɓə kwu shnika ga fye fyewyi nyi. <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />Shi fye ba dəye, nlonu nu n fye ɓa myi fya ɓwa gənyikpe əmi awyega Kirisiti asigyi nya, <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />ədo n a to ɓə wu aza kwo n acala aje m, ngye shi Zafnu wo la kwo kpeyawu Shekwoyi atnutnuloyi agyigyiyi ɓədo n sheaɓəgwognayi nsaiye nyi m. <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />Asigyiyi ye əɓa nu ge, dna n nabagyi manai, Abyedo ɓa kwu zhni abeɓyi ɓədo n Israilai, aza n ɓa kwnufyi n nayi gbmanyi, jesnu aza n ɓa kwnu ɓəgbeshi gwo fyi n Kirisiti Yeisu.<verse eid="EPH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />Mi ɓə la zè nabagyi manai ye tnutnuyi ntu Shekwoyi shebmyashi nyaga ɓo, ń wo ɓə ga mi dna ń tńutńuzhni əwo kalá nya. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Kwo shikwonyi əmi nu gnagbagbai lo dna n Shekwoyi aza vnyanya, a ɓə la shebmyashi ye ga mi: ma zhni waazi ga Abyedo, Kirisiti nyaɓwa ń a taa myì a zo kwo ɓəyekpe vnyanya m, <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />jesnu ma kwu asigyi ye aɓəfyekpe wu zahozahoyi pəipəi, ədo n a ɓə ncei sodna n Shekwoyi, n aye bəgye n ɓa la duya nyi, n wo ɓə zhni anya vnyanya nyi. <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />Əwo ɓəmwi nu ɓə nyi ge nsaiye, dna n ikilisiya, a ɓa wu Shekwoyi wyemwa loloi n abegyiyi aba, ɓədo n aikwodai fyi n ashebmana, <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />kwoi vyi əwo ɓəmwi nyalonyalo nya, n wo ɓə kwu kwo nu dna n Kirisiti Yeisu, əyi Dagayi. <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />Dna n wo jesnu dna n gaiciyaga n wo, yi ɓa myi ya yegwu Shekwoyi n loloyai jesnu n agwumyii. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Ntucenu, mi gna fye nge, fye to bmabwugba ntu azhnìgye ɓo n mi gye n əfye ɓo m, ɓa zhni əfye latu nu.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aduwazhni ntu n Afyisuyi ɓo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Ntu dəye ɓo, mi ceakwokwo shi nyi n Dada abye, <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />aba n pwuwa dəhodəhoi n əshemi ɓədo n anyii ɓwa əkwo əye. <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />Mi zhniaduwa ge, dna n əwo nyaɓwa latu nya, n wo ɓa kwu fye myizhi dna n ikwo əwo Zafnu nya n əfye əza əmi nya, <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />nabai n Kirisiti ɓaa sase dna n əfye adu dna n gaiciyaga. Mi je aduwazhni nge fya kwu myizhi n agbegyei myimyii dna n yeye, <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />fya myi fya ɓwa kalá, n kwnusnu n Dagayi aza agyigyiyii vnyanya, fya kpe ngye shi Kirisiti yeye nsnu lo ń pata, n kpaai, n asnayii jesnu she kwo loloi lo nsnu, <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />jesnu fya kpe yeye ye n kwo du ɓəyekpe tu; nabai n fye ɓa myi fya kwu nu zhi n Shekwoyi nunui vnyanya.<verse eid="EPH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Nsaiye, ga əwo n wo myi woi zhni aɓo n du shi a ɓa myi n mwi vnyanya, n yi nyaɓo kwo n yi zhninubwo nyi, kwoi vyi əwo kalá n əkwo nu zhni tnutnu fyi n əyi nyi, <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />latu zhni əwo nya nu dna n ikilisiya njesnu dna n Kirisiti Yeisu kwa lo acala vnyanya nyalonyalo! Amyi.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Gbedogwnu dna n Kirisiti nayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Əmi, ngye zhaluda ntu Dagayi ɓo, nlonu mi gyi fye əwye nge fye gyianyì n kwnuce n yiyii ń fye la gwo nyi. <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />Fye kwu əfyehni atukwogba shaasha, jesnu fya zhni pəceye, fya ɓwamì n ajei dna n yeye. <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />Fye zhni ɓəhoɓəhoi nabai fya shi gbedogwnu Zafnu nya ɓwa, dna n bwugbafu n kwo nu n fyei yeɓədo nyi. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Nayi lo gbmanyi nu jesnu Zafnu gbmanyi, n ɓwasnu shi a ɓə yi fye fyi n awyetu gbmanyi nu, əsa n a ɓə yi fye nyi. <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Dagayi gbmanyi, gaiciyaga gbmanyi, batizima gbmanyi; <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />Shekwoyi gbmanyi, əwo nu zhni Dada anya vnyanya nya, ń əwo nu tu n anya vnyanya əshe nyi, fyi n anya vnyanya jesnu fyi n aɓo vnyanya.<verse eid="EPH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Ama a la shebmyashi ga zahozahoyi, shi Kirisiti ɓə gná kwo ya ga nyi. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Cenuzhni kwoi gna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">“Əsa n wo ɓə gwnulo əshemi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">wo ɓə la aza-wnawnayi bəgyé kwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">jesnu wa kwu anyaga ga əwo aza.”<verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />(Knyiyi nu gyi nge “Wa gwnulo əshemi” awyega? Kwo wu nu ge wo ɓə la shniɓe dna n əknyi snuta! <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Əza n wo ɓə shniɓe nyi, əwo nu ɓwa jesnu n wo ɓə gwnulo wa du ashe ya vnyanya, nabai n wo ɓa nu anyì vnyanya.) <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Ntulonu Kirisiti n əwohni tukwoi nu ɓə ga anyaga ye: atnutnuloyi, asheɓəgwognayi, awaazizhniyi, apasto n anyawuyii. <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />Nabai wa kwu atnutnu akaya fyi əwo aza na akwnu ntu n tnutnu zhni ɓo, nabai ami Kirisiti nayi. <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />Kwa nya əsa n əyi vnyanya ɓə lá ɓwadnado dna n gaiciyaga, jesnu dna n ɓəyekpe Shekwoyi Nugwnu nya, jesnu yii kwu akpikwo, yii kwu si aba n yi ɓə kwu zhi n nunuyi n Kirisitii vnyanya.<verse eid="EPH 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />Nlonu yi to ɓə kwu je zhi n zhni aɓyipwutu, ai zè əyi awye gwnugwnu n shnishnii m, ai knyiaɓwaya lo ɓwoye n ɓwayii n nyawu dəhodəhoi n agbakwnuyi nukwoi azagyifyiyii, zhni apma ncei n əɓa kwocedna m. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />N əkwoɓwi, yi da gaiciyanunui dna n yeye, ya mwa ya kwu zè əwo nayi akpikwoi fyi n zokwo dəhodəhoi n əwo nu zhni tukwo nyi, Kirisiti nuu nu. <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />A n nayi yeɓədo vnyanya dna n əwo nu, njesnu əji ɓwaceyi dəhodəhoi n kwoi wnashi n abagbmanyi, kwoi mwa kwoi mi əkwohni dna n yeye, shi səpa dəhodəhoi zhni əkwo tnutnu.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Agbega ntu Kirisitiavyiyi anyìgyi ɓo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Ntulonu mi gna fye ɓəye, jesnu mi la gyitu n kwo dna n Dagayi, nge ɓəshishi nu fye taa je anyìgyi shi Abyedo gyi nyi m kpeekpe, dna n əɓa ɓənubwozhni gbəloi m. <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />Əba awyega fyi wyegbma lo jesnu n gnaje gnagnaiya n Shekwoyi wyewyeyii, ntu tnagənyikpe ɓo n kwo fyilo n ɓa, ntu əɓa adu kalákpe ɓo. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Ɓa kwu ɓwu əɓa ɓənubwokpezhni nuwna vnyanya, ɓa kwu ɓahni ga nayi aɓəpwawo, nabai ɓa myi ɓa lofyi n asisi dəhodəhoi pya, jesnu ɓa nunui lo n fnanai. <verse eid="EPH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Shikwonyi, fye to ɓə ɓwa Kirisiti yekpé dna n zokwo yi nu m. <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />She fye ɓə wo Kirisiti ɓo, jesnu a kwu gaiciyanunui wu fye, shikwonyi dna n Yeisu. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />Ntu əfye anyìgyi kwokwoyi ɓo, a ɓə kwu wu fye nge, fye la əfye əza kwokwoyi kpmaya, n kwo gnyi kwoi wnuya n əkwo aɓəpwawo kwocedna nyai nyi; <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />a kwu fye zhni awoiwoyi fyi n aɓonubwozhni əfye abwugba nya; <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />njesnu fya kwu əzawoiwoyi kpe, n a ɓə zhni wo, waa wu ngye Shekwoyi dna n ɓəfyece hnihnii n gyigyii.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Ntucenu ɓəshishinu zahozahoyi n fye, wa fa akatáce ɓo, jesnu wa da gaiciyanunui n əwo kwnuzhiyii, ntuge əyi vnyanya zhni aga nu nayi gbmanyi nya. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />“Dna n əho minagyi to zhni leifyi m” To ye nyipyei kwa shni hoi ye tu n əho minagyi m, <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />jesnu to ga Shetam apita tu aba m. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Zahozahoyi n wo wyi əvyì lo, ɓəshishinu wa fa əvyiwyi ɓo, ama ɓəshishinu wa zhni tnutnu, wa zhni əɓo n kwo n apmai n əwohni aɓwai, nabai wa ɓwa nyaho wa ce ga aza yi n ɓa fyilo n əsnagyi.<verse eid="EPH 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />To ye ɓəda nukwoi dəhodəhoi kwa gbmiɓe n əho əgbe m, akpəge əɓo n kwo ɓa ga bmazhni ntu azaje mimi ɓo, shi ɓa n əkwo apmai lo, nabai n kwo ɓa bma aza yi zhni n ɓa wo nyi. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Njesnu fye to dna Zafnu Gyigyiyi Shekwoyi nya minagyi m, a ɓə tu fye əznù n əwoi nu, ntu nyipyei shnashna nya ɓo. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Fye la bwugbalilii kwnuya vnyanya, n napyei n minagyii, anyàwu n əyewnuyai, ɓədo n ɓəshinmì dəhodəhoi pyai. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Fye zhni aje shebmyashi njesnu fya wu aje snusnugye, fyei zo aje abwi n ɓwasnu shi, dna n Kirisiti, Shekwoyi ɓə zo fye abwi nyi.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Ntucenu, fye vyi Shekwoyi ɓədogbe, ngye aɓyi ayeyeyi <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />fya znazna fyi n yeye, n ɓwasnu shi Kirisiti ɓə ye yi wa ga əwohni tukwo ntu əyi ɓo n zhni nyaga snidaí jesnu nyagbmi ga Shekwoyi.<verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Ama fyi n əfye, a to wo asisiɓozhni əɓo kwo liya m, kwo aɓədodna ho pya, kwo fnana m, ntuge aɓo ye to gwogwolo n Shekwoyi aza gyigyiyii m. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Kwo acegyeɓəzhni, n ɓəda tnatukwogyii, kwo aɓocící, ɓa to fyilo n zokwo m, ama kwo du ya ga Shekwoyi amisa nu.<verse eid="EPH 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Ntu ɓəye ɓo, fye ɓa kpəge: asisiɓozhniyi ntnagyiyi kwo fnanada, əza yi pya zhni shnagbayi nu, wo to n əgwúi lo dna n Kirisiti əbemi n Shekwoyi nyai m. <verse eid="EPH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Fye to ye əzaho wa dna fye kwoce n aɓədagbma agbəloii m, ntu aɓo ye ɓo nù n Shekwoyi minagyi napyei ɓe kpe n aza yi n ɓa ta vyi ɓəgbetu nyi m. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Ntucenu fye to dnaɓwado n əɓai m.<verse eid="EPH 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />Ntuge fye ɓə zhni wyegbma nu dna nsaho, ama nsaiye fye zhni bwuznagna nu dna ń Dagayi. Fye gyianyì ngye bwuznagna aɓyi. <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />(Ntuge gyigyiga bwuznagna nya kwo zhni ɓəmanai nu vnyanya, ɓəfyecezhni n gaiciyanunui). <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />Nlonu fye zna əɓo shni n əkwo ɓo da Dagayi. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Fye to dnaɓwa n wyegbma atnutnu gbəloi m, ama fye kpmi ɓa anya ya wu pəipəi. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Kwo zhni əɓo vnyinkwo nya nu kwo a sa ɓəye pya ye ń atnaɓəgbetuvyiyi zhni fyi n ɓwiɓwi. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Ama nyahonyahoi n bwuznagna la fnukpe n kwo a ɓa gye kwo əwye, jesnu nyahonyahoi n bwuznagna la knaya kpe n kwo, kwo la zè bwuznagna. <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />Cenuzhni ai gna:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">“Gyewnayi, la kwnu-agyewyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">la laka n əfyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">Kirisiti ɓa fnukpe n ho.”<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Fye zhni pəceye dəidəi shi fye gyianyì nsaiye, toge ngye atna-ceceyi m, ama ngye aza aceceyi, <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />fyei zhni apma n əsa dəhodəhoi n fya ɓwa, ntuge anyipyei ye zhni anukwoi nu. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Ntucenu fye to kwu zhni amama m, ama fye ɓwa awyega əɓo n kwo zhni Dagayi ɓəye. <verse eid="EPH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Fye to sni anamnuwna m, n kwo dna əza ɓənukwoizhni nyi m. N əkwoɓwi fye kwu nu n Zafnui, <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />fye daɓo n ajei n anyiásásayii, anyíciciyii jesnu n anyii n ɓa kwnu n Zafnu. Fye kwoanyi fyei gyianya n ɓa kwnu n əfye abwugba ga Dagayi, <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />fyei ga Shekwoyi Dada amisa ciici, ntu nyahonyahoi ɓo, dna ń əyi Dagayi Yeisu Kirisiti əye.<verse eid="EPH 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Agbega ntu Kirisitiavyiyi apwuwa ɓo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Fye kwu əfyehni ga aje, ntu Kirisiti mwamwaga ɓo.<verse eid="EPH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Anyikwo anusei, fye kwu əfyehni ga əfyehnii aɓá shi fye ga Dagayi nyi. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Ntuge əɓá nu zhni əwo nyikwo tukwo, ngye shi Kirisiti nu zhni ikilisiya tukwo nyi, əwo nayi, n əwo nu zhni əkwo Gnyiyi nyi. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Nsaiye shi ikilisiya n kwohnii ga Kirisiti nyi, nlonu ce n anyikwo anusei ɓa ɓa kwu əɓahni ga fyi n əɓa aɓá akwnu n ɓəhoɓəhoi.<verse eid="EPH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Aɓá, fye ye ǹ əfye anyikwoi, n ɓwasnu shi Kirisiti ɓə ye n ikilisiyai nyi, wa ga əwohni tukwo ntu kwo ɓo, <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />waa kwo zè gyigyiyi, woi pmya kwo, dna n zhnazhna n nuwna Shekwoyi ɓədagbma nyai, <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />jesnu wa ɓe n woi n əwohni aba, ngye ikilisiya bmyabmyai, ntna cegye kwo abwi dəhodəhoi, kwo ɓətui, ama n gyigyiyi jesnu ntnaɓətu. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />N ɓwasnu nlai nu, n aɓá gwo ɓa ye n əɓa anyikwoi ngye əɓahni anayi. Əza n wo ye n əwo nyikwoi, wo ye əwohni nu. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Nshnisnusnu, əzaho to lo n wo wnu əwohni nayi nu m, ama wo ga nyagyi woi wna kwo akna n ɓwasnu shi Kirisiti wna ikilisiya akna nyi, <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />ntuge yi zhni əwo nayi aga nu. <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />“Ntu dəye ɓo, zanugbayi ɓa fa əwo dada n əwo əyai jesnu wa nyima əwo nyikwo, jesnu əɓa ngwnu-aba ɓa ɓə kwu zè nayi gbmanyi” <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Dəye nu zhni asigyi kpokəloi, ama mi daɓo tu n Kirisiti ɓo nu n ikilisiyai. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Dudulonu, ɓəshishi nu zahozahoyi wa ye n əwo nyikwoi ngye shi wo ye əwohni, njesnu ɓəshishi nu nyikwo wa ga əwo əɓá mwamwa.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Aɓyi, fye vyi əfye azamayi ɓəda dna ń Dagayi, ntuge dəye dnalo n ɓəfyece zokwo. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />“Ga əho dada mwamwa n əho əyai” əkwo nu zhni ɓəgbetu kpmisnui n ɓəgbei shi, <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />nabai ń aɓo ɓa lo ho n bmya jesnu ha wo wyewyeyi kpamwai agbmada dna n anyì.<verse eid="EPH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Adada, fye to fyi əfye aɓyi minagyi m; n əkwoɓwi fye shi ɓa fyi ń tata ɓədo n Dagayi gbegai.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Afyenu, fye vyi əfye adagayi anyì nya ɓəda n mwamwagai n ədnawoi, jesnu n ədu ɓəhnihni nyai, n ɓwasnu shi fye ɓa vyi Kirisiti ɓəda nyi. <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />Fye vyi əɓa ɓəda, toge fye ye fya ɓwa əɓa bmyashi nu ɓwa m, əsa n ɓa gye fye əwye lo m, ama ngye Kirisiti afyenu, fyei zhni Shekwoyi ɓəye fyi n əfye adu. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Fye zhni tnutnu n əfye abwugbai vnyanya, ngye fye zhni Dagayi nu tnutnu, toge ngye fye zhni ga aza m, <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />ntuge fye kpəlo nge Dagayi ɓə ga zahozahoyi n fye gyiba ntu əɓo manai dəhodəhoi ɓo n wo zhni, kwo woi zhni fyenu nu kwo əza loloiya. <verse eid="EPH 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Adagayi, fye zhni əfye afyenu əɓəmanai. Fye to fyi ɓa ədna m, shikwonyi fye kpəlo nge əza n wo zhni əɓa Dagayi n əfye nyai nyi, wo dnalo n əshemi, wo ta gwo aza woi wu ɓa kakai m.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shekwoyi akwnuakaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />N kpmasnu, fye kwu akalá fyi dna n Dagayi, jesnu dna n əwo ikwodudui akalá. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Fye kwu Shekwoyi akwnuakaya kpe n nunui, nabai n fye ɓa myi fya gnyiapaapa n Shetam agbákwnui. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Ntuge əyi abwafyi to zhni nayi ń amii nya nu m, ama ǹ abegyiyii, ń aikwoi, ǹ akalái fyi n wyegbma anyì ye nya, jesnu n azafnu ɓənukwoizhni nya ń ashebmana. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Ntucenu fye kwu Shekwoyi akwnuakaya anunui kpe vnyanya, nabai shi nyipyei nukwoi ɓə ɓe, fye ɓə myi fya gnyiagnyi zhi, n fya kwu ɓəhoɓəhoi zozhni, fya kwu myizhi. <verse eid="EPH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Fye kwu myizhi nsaiye, fye kwu gaiciyanunui shnipanya pa n əfye ashni, fya kwu ɓəfyecezhni agwuɓwunya kpe n əɓa aba. <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />Fye kwu abwada fyi n əfye apita n fyehni yeyei fya lo n nabagyi manai bwugbafu nyai. <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />Ənya n fye ɓa ɓe n aɓo ye vnyanya, fye la okwnukpáta gaiciyaga nya la, n əkwoi nu n fye ɓa myi fya wnu əzanukwoyi aknawyi əná ncei. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />La snuknakàta gnyignyi nya la, n əbeyakwo Zafnu nyai, n kwo nu zhni Shekwoyi ɓədagbma nyi. <verse eid="EPH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Fye zhniaduwa fyi n Zafnu n asai vnyanya, n aduwazhni dəhodəhoi pyai, n wyegyii. N ɓəyei dna n bwugba, fye kwu zhi n əfyehnii yeyei jesnu ciici fyei zhniaduwa ntu n Dagayi aza ɓo vnyanya.<verse eid="EPH 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />Fye zhniaduwa ntu əmi ɓo ce, nabai nge əsahosahoi n ma daɓo ncei, a ɓa ga mi aɓədagbma n mi ɓa da, ma wu asigyi nabagyi manai nya ntna ədnawoi, <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />ntu əkwo ɓo nu n mi zhni kwo ambasado dna n agbma nyi. Zhniaduwa ma myi ma da kwo ntna ədnawoi, shi mi ɓa myi.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gnaɓyi kpmasnui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Ticikwus, əmizado yeyei njesnu tnutnuyi gbenuyii dna n Dagayi, wo ɓa gna fye ɓəhoɓəhoi, nabai əfyehni ce fya kpe shi aɓo n mii lo, n əɓoi n mi zhni lo. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Mi tnu fye n woi ntu n ɓəye tukwo nu, nabai nge fya kpe shi yi lo, jesnu wa kwu əfye bwugbamyizhi.<verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Bwugbafu ga əyi azanugbai aje n əyi amapwii, jesnu yeye n kwnusnu n gaiciyagai n kwo gbmi ń Shekwoyi Dada aba n Dagayi Yeisu Kirisitii. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Shebmyashi kwo kwnusnu n azai vnyanya n ɓa ye əyi Dagayi Yeisu Kirisiti n yeyei n kwo ta shna fyí nyi m.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>